{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"7b89c72f381a5792a5daa343fcc73aa32abdf8665156f0096f49264457919dfb","ja":"響と奈緒の新たな挑戦！","zh":"响与奈绪的新挑战！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"3f95459a2f8ded0db0ed45504200ce1ba3cf3f73147ea875d90770d71484d22b","ja":"奈緒、聞いたぞ！\n今度ドラマのオーディション、受けるんだってね。","zh":"奈绪，我听说了哦！\n听说你下次要去参加电视剧的试镜呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"304be5bd6979bbcc595d0b9999f58132426921697e9f1808733a83a40ad53342","ja":"うん、主人公の学生時代の役。\nなんで知って……って、まさか響も！？","zh":"嗯，是主角学生时代的角色。\n你怎么会知……等等，难道响也演了！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"c14fed6f674a5353ced1cc5e1c3e5e9daf6ae8d0842cb0ea81beadd65f99f694","ja":"へへへ……実は自分も受けることになったんだ！\nさっそく、台本を読みはじめたぞ。","zh":"嘿嘿嘿……其实我也要去参加选拔了！\n这就开始看剧本啦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"a422ed77d4f7e1623c395ba6e80cc1ca4c2562c8692b006c02e7cf8142bbfb77","ja":"あ、私もちょうど読み始めたとこやで！\nドラマのストーリー、結構面白そうやんな♪","zh":"啊，我也刚好才开始读呢！\n电视剧的剧情，感觉挺有意思的吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"404c222ea7ed2a29fc99bf5b3d40ce67ee1f0b1fba7e743dbee7f11858cec37e","ja":"うん。\n王道ラブコメって、わかりやすくていいよね！","zh":"嗯。\n王道恋爱喜剧简单易懂，挺不错的呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d8a0fe9059b1b474931db56affa9bc533bea2576c98d91f24c5fa947e6428f5d","ja":"せやな～♪　主人公が学生時代に付き合っていた相手と\n結婚できるかどうかって話で……。","zh":"对吧～♪ 讲的是主角能不能和学生时代交往的对象\n结婚的故事……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"c6bda946a8070d3f1ffed9d59e4c5cbd7eb41aed7c69616e11660e4dd45ebfcc","ja":"オーディションの役、かなり重要みたいやし！\n私の演技でお茶の間をキュンキュンさせたるわ♪","zh":"试镜的角色好像相当重要呢！\n看我用演技让电视机前的观众心动不已吧♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"6355e9b79bbb9189ff7eda14eade9165c9bd91d3a92125760d7cbe161d5410d3","ja":"自分は視聴者のみんなを、\nハラハラドキドキさせる演技がしたいぞ！","zh":"我想用自己的演技，\n让观众们都感到惊心动魄、心跳加速！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f5e025a78333acda274e5bc43c180bace5af9cd4e08c875a882135921809df8a","ja":"お互い頑張ろうね！　正々堂々勝負して、\nどちらが受かっても恨みっこなしだぞ！","zh":"我们都要加油哦！堂堂正正地比一场，\n不管谁合格了都不许记恨对方哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1254.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"caf184bba8aa91bb8f371c64032a2ca8c15c2a48c1ecc39eaddb0b07149f49c5","ja":"もちろんや！　全力でいかせてもらうで！\nオーディション、楽しみやな～！","zh":"那是当然！我会全力以赴的！\n试镜，好期待呀～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
